Acknowledgements
----------------

The Network UPS Tools project (https://networkupstools.org) for the NUT
protocol, the upsd server, and the drivers Nux depends on. Nux is an
independent client and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the NUT project.

The NUT project's own Java client, jNut (https://github.com/networkupstools/jNut),
was studied while implementing NUT 2.8 command tracking. No jNut code is used
in Nux; see CLAUDE.md for why it was evaluated and not adopted as a dependency.

Nux is developed with the assistance of AI coding tools.
